  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Decentralized Health Capacities in Border Areas amidst the COVID-19 and Other Epidemic Prone Diseases in Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at contributing to the prevention and spread of the COVID-19 pandemic and other epidemic-prone diseases along the borders and other areas of high human mobility through reinforcing the decentralization of COVID-19 health response capacities in three border regions (Boke, Kankan and Nz&#xe9;r&#xe9;kor&#xe9;). On a larger scale, the proposed project contributes to advancing the Universal Health Coverage (UHC) objectives in Guinea amid the COVID-19 pandemic through reinforced coordination, detection, isolation, notification, and diagnosis of potential cases.</narrative>
  </description>
